--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE / FIDELITY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The web `DevToolsPage.tsx` is a thin tabbed shell: a PageContainer (title + subtitle)
over a TabNav (5 tabs) whose FadeIn body switches between five imported sections. The
manifest record for `page:admin/DevTools` scopes the unit to that page file
(sourceFiles=[DevToolsPage.tsx], dataSources=none, strings=[devtools.title,
devtools.subtitle], requiredCount=2). ADR-011 forbids stubs, so every tab is reproduced
with real native content (no "coming soon"):

  • Fleet API   — Setup Wizard (7 onboarding steps) + Fleet API tool grid (9 cards).
  • Telemetry   — Error VINs + Error Log cards with loading/empty/data/error + VIN filter.
  • Infrastructure — 5 backend diagnostic tool cards (DB stats, migrations, MQTT test,
                     env check, runtime info).
  • Utilities   — searchable grid of all 15 client-side tools (VIN, JWT, timestamp,
                  base64, URL, JSON, UUID, hash, byte size, color, cron, HTTP status,
                  Tesla API ref, regex, unix perms) — every one fully functional via pure
                  local computation (matches the manifest's "renders from local state").
  • Reference   — 4 documentation link cards.

Architecture (ADR-004): a pure `@Observable DevToolsPageModel` holds the deep-linkable
tab state and exposes injected seams (`DevToolsBackend`, `FleetTelemetryHealthSource`)
defaulting to representative local seeds — no networking in any view. Per-card state lives
in small `@Observable` holders (`DevToolsRunModel`, `FleetTelemetryHealthModel`). Display
units/timestamps are formatted at the boundary; SI is never stored/computed. Strings are
SwiftUI `LocalizedStringKey` from Localizable.xcstrings with the web key names
(`translation.devtools.*`); zero hardcoded UI literals (data values use Text(verbatim:)).
Design tokens (P2) + shared components (P3: TSGlassPanel/TSTabs/TSButton/TSTextField/
TSEmptyState/TSSpinner/TSSkeleton/TSBadge/TSIconBox/typography) only — no hand-rolled glass,
no web cloning. a11y: VoiceOver labels/traits on panels, tabs, rows, links; Dynamic Type;
≥44pt targets; light/dark + increased-contrast via the dynamic token palette.

Files (all under apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/, + nav + catalog + tests):
  DevToolsPage.swift              — the View shell (header + TSTabs + faded section switch)
  DevToolsPageModel.swift         — @Observable model, DevToolsTab, backend seam, run model
  DevToolsHealthModel.swift       — telemetry-health @Observable model + seam + sample
  DevToolsUtilLogic.swift         — pure client-side computations (DevToolsUtil)
  DevToolsCron.swift              — cron describe/next-runs (DevToolsUtil extension)
  DevToolsCatalog.swift           — VIN/HTTP/Tesla reference data tables
  DevToolsCatalogUI.swift         — infra/fleet/reference/onboarding view catalogs
  DevToolsComponents.swift        — tool card / result panel / copy / backend tool card
  DevToolsSections.swift          — Fleet API / Infrastructure / Reference sections
  DevToolsTelemetrySection.swift  — Telemetry health section
  DevToolsUtilities.swift         — utilities search grid + expandable card + 15-tool registry
  DevToolsUtilityToolsA.swift     — 8 utility tool views
  DevToolsUtilityToolsB.swift     — 7 utility tool views
  DevToolsRouteRegistration.swift — registers .devTools route
  Sources/App/AppRoute.swift      — +.devTools (pathSegment "dev-tools", group .system, icon)
  Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift      — composes DevToolsRouteRegistration into the route host
  Localization/Localizable.xcstrings — +159 translation.devtools.* + route.devTools keys
  Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/DevTools{PageModel,UtilLogic,RouteRegistration}Tests.swift

